WEBVTT

00:00:59.354 --> 00:01:00.863
How about a two-digit number?

00:01:00.887 --> 00:01:01.976
Audience: 22.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.008
AB: 22. And another two-digit number, sir?

00:01:04.032 --> 00:01:05.039
Audience: 47.

00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:08.976
AB: Multiply 22 times 47,
make sure you get 1,034,

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.737
or the calculators are not working.

00:01:10.761 --> 00:01:13.905
Do all of you get 1,034? 1,034?

00:01:13.929 --> 00:01:14.976
Volunteer: No.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.976
AB: 594. Let's give three of them
a nice round of applause there.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:20.976
(Applause)

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.229
Would you like to try a more
standard calculator, just in case?

00:01:24.253 --> 00:01:25.365
OK, great.

00:01:25.389 --> 00:01:27.112
What I'm going to try and do then --

00:01:27.136 --> 00:01:30.421
I notice it took some of you
a little bit of time to get your answer.